# Mobile dependency check

Follow the "Mobile dependency check (expo-doctor)" section in `CLAUDE.md`. Summary:

- After changing mobile dependencies, and before any mobile build or release, run `cd mobile && npm run doctor` (Node 22.13+).
- Fix SDK version mismatches with `cd mobile && npx expo install --fix`, then re-run until all checks pass. Report anything it can't fix instead of working around it.
